  "givens": "Python 3.13, UTF-8 독립 스크립트, 외부 입력 없음.  루트A, A.left=B, A.right=C, B.left=None, B.right=D, C/D는 잎.",
  "code": "tree={'A':('B','C'),'B':(None,'D'),'C':(None,None),'D':(None,None)}\nout=[]\ndef walk(node):\n    if node is None:\n        return\n    left,right=tree[node]\n    walk(left)\n    out.append(node)\n    walk(right)\nwalk('A')\nprint(' '.join(out))\n",
